{"id": "4623", "type": "page", "slug": "diabetes-hw", "path": "health-challenges/diabetes-hw", "title": "Diabetes HW", "date": "2025-04-21 10:44:59", "modified": "2025-06-24 15:17:16", "excerpt": "", "content": "<h1>Addressing type 2 diabetes\n</h1>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>Hippocrates wellness health retreat\n</h1>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1><b>Managing TYPE 2 Diabetes</b> Empowering You to Take Control of Your Health</h1>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>At Hippocrates Wellness (FL, USA), the world-leading tropical wellness retreat for 70 years, we offer an unmatched history and scientifically-supported approach to help people overcome the challenges of type-2 Diabetes.</p><p>As the Pioneers of Wellness, we don't just offer a retreat; we offer a lifestyle, integrating plant-based nutrition, cutting-edge treatments, advanced fitness training, mental and emotional support, and revolutionary insights from global wellness experts. We know that Diabetes is not merely a physical struggle; it's an intricate interplay of mind, body, and spirit. Our signature 21-day Life Transformation Program addresses your whole being to support long-lasting health and balance. </p><p><strong>Start your wellness journey today, and discover the ultimate pathway to enhanced longevity and vitality.</strong></p><picture><source srcset=\"/media/lqic0vjb/istock-611073344.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=655&amp;rnd=132946064665770000, /media/lqic0vjb/istock-611073344.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=982&amp;rnd=132946064665770000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 1500px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/lqic0vjb/istock-611073344.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=525&amp;rnd=132946064665770000, /media/lqic0vjb/istock-611073344.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=788&amp;rnd=132946064665770000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1499px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/lqic0vjb/istock-611073344.jpg